  [1mB: A [38;5;153mHEALTH[39m column plus a failure list under the table.[0m The column says [38;5;153mok[39m or [38;5;153m2 failing[39m. Below the table, each failing
  check is listed with its detail. The table stays narrow and you get the full detail, at the cost of a few extra lines
  when something is failing.
  [38;5;153mSERVICE         VERSION   READY   DEPLOYED           HEALTH[39m
  [38;5;153mapi-gateway     2.14.1    3/3     2026-09-29 14:02   ok[39m
