  [1mC: Everything inline.[0m The column holds names and details: [38;5;153mfailing: db-connection (timeout after 5s)[39m. Nothing is
  hidden, but rows get long and wrap in normal-width terminals.

  [1mMy recommendation is B.[0m You can see at a glance which services are unhealthy, and the next question, "why?", is
  answered in the same output without making the table hard to read. In every option the heading would also get a count,
  e.g. [38;5;153m10 services, 3 failing health checks[39m.
